OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,FAmbitious plans to build an indoor
OL,7,Fsports arena at Ulster University's
OL,8,FLondonderry campus have been scrapped
OL,9,Fdue to funding pressures.
OL,11,FThe university had previously hailed
OL,12,Fproposals for the multimillion-pound
OL,13,F15,000 square metre Air Dome as "game-
OL,14,Fchanging" for the north-west and "a
OL,15,Ffirst-of-its-scale facility for
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland".
OL,26,@uD@aOUvD@IO]vD@bOUxD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/16
