PN,41802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,FHowever, Ulster University has now
OL,7,Fconfirmed to the Press Association
OL,8,Fthat the project is "no longer
OL,9,Ffinancially viable within our current
OL,10,Fcontext".
OL,12,FThe Department for the Economy
OL,13,Fdescribed the move as "disappointing",
OL,14,Fbut said minister Caoimhe Archibald
OL,15,F"remains fully committed" to growing
OL,16,Fstudent numbers at the campus.
OL,18,FHowever, an SDLP MLA has said the
OL,19,Fdecision raises concerns about the
OL,20,Ffuture expansion of the university's
OL,21,FMagee campus.
OL,26,@pD@UOUrD@HO]uD@WOUuD@eO]wD@AOUwD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
