PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,FThe university has said the decision
OL,7,Fis an inevitable outcome of the "lack
OL,8,Fof a sustainable funding model for
OL,9,Fhigher education in Northern Ireland".
OL,11,FThe university had announced plans to
OL,12,Fbuild the Air Dome in 2024 at the
OL,13,Fdisused Foyle College site.
OL,15,FPlans included capacity for several
OL,16,Fthousand spectators and the arena
OL,17,Fwould have housed full-size pitches
OL,18,Ffor multiple sports including rugby,
OL,19,Ffootball and Gaelic games.
OL,26,@oD@aOUqD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
