PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,FIt was also intended to host community
OL,7,Fand musical events.
OL,9,FPeacePlus funding at the time was
OL,10,Fannounced of 10.86 million euro (#9.05
OL,11,Fmillion) by the SEUPB (Special EU
OL,12,FProgrammes Body).
OL,14,FThe university had said it would match
OL,15,Fthe funding.
OL,17,FHowever, it has now concluded that
OL,18,Frising costs have made the project
OL,19,Funsustainable.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
