FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,FA statement from Ulster University
OL,7,Fsaid: "Ongoing construction inflation
OL,8,Fand unsustainable running cost
OL,9,Fprojections has caused Ulster
OL,10,FUniversity to conclude that the Dome
OL,11,FProject is no longer financially
OL,12,Fviable within our current context.
OL,14,F"We are disappointed, but we must
OL,15,Fprioritise our limited resources on
OL,16,Fcore activities of delivering
OL,17,Fexcellence in teaching, research with
OL,18,Fimpact, and in delivering City Deals.
OL,26,@oD@GOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,F"This outcome is an inevitable
OL,7,Fconsequence of the constrained
OL,8,Ffinancial position we are placed in as
OL,9,Fa result of the lack of a sustainable
OL,10,Ffunding model for higher education in
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,13,F"This is one of the difficult but
OL,14,Funavoidable decisions that we are
OL,15,Fhaving to make given the context we
OL,16,Fare being expected to operate in."
OL,18,FThe statement added: "We are however
OL,19,Fexploring other options for bolstering
OL,20,Four sports facilities on the Derry/
OL,21,FLondonderry campus.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUxD@bO]zD@VOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
