SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,F"We remain committed to working with
OL,7,FSEUPB across a range of projects and
OL,8,Fwith local partners and stakeholders
OL,9,Fin the north west, even as we navigate
OL,10,Fthese constrained times."
OL,12,FA spokesperson for the Department for
OL,13,Fthe Economy said: "It is disappointing
OL,14,Fthat the Dome Project is not
OL,15,Fproceeding.
OL,17,F"However, the project would not
OL,18,Fdirectly contribute to student numbers
OL,19,Fat Magee and the minister remains
OL,20,Ffully committed to the 10,000 student
OL,21,Fnumbers target.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@YO]uD@SOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
