PN,41808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,F"There are plans in partnership with
OL,7,FUlster University to again increase
OL,8,Fstudent numbers at Magee this
OL,9,FSeptember, which will build on the 22%
OL,10,Fincrease achieved over the last two
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,F"The minister continues to make the
OL,14,Fcase for additional funding for
OL,15,Funiversities."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUwD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/16
