PN,41809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,FSDLP Foyle MLA Sinead McLaughlin said:
OL,7,F"This project was announced two years
OL,8,Fago to much fanfare as part of the
OL,9,Fongoing plans to expand Ulster
OL,10,FUniversity's Magee campus and increase
OL,11,Fstudent numbers.
OL,13,F"Today we are being told that it has
OL,14,Fbeen scrapped and there will be real
OL,15,Ffrustration and concern in our city
OL,16,Fabout what this means for the
OL,17,Fexpansion of Magee as a whole.
OL,26,@nD@SrroD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,F"I understand that Ulster University
OL,7,Fand third-level education generally
OL,8,Ffaces significant financial pressures
OL,9,Fand these need to be addressed in
OL,10,Ftandem with the Economy Minister and
OL,11,FExecutive.
OL,13,F"However, it feels like when there are
OL,14,Fprojects to be scrapped or cuts to be
OL,15,Fmade Magee is first in line."
OL,17,FShe added: "The SDLP is fully
OL,18,Fsupportive of the expansion of Magee,
OL,19,Fit's in our DNA, but for the past few
OL,20,Fyears it has been one step forwards
OL,21,Fand two steps back.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUwD@]O]yD@LOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,F"The Economy Minister and Ulster
OL,7,FUniversity have made commitments to
OL,8,FMagee and the people of Derry and they
OL,9,Fmust answer for their failure to
OL,10,Fdeliver upon them.
OL,12,F"This city has waited long enough for
OL,13,Fthe university it deserves."
OL,15,FUniversity bosses in Northern Ireland
OL,16,Fhave repeatedly raised concerns about
OL,17,Ftheir financial position.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUuD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/16
