PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,FLast year, the heads of Queen's
OL,7,FUniversity, Ulster University and the
OL,8,FOpen University in Ireland had warned
OL,9,Fthat failure to tackle a funding
OL,10,Fcrisis in the sector would force them
OL,11,Fto cut places for local students, as
OL,12,Fthey insisted the current arrangements
OL,13,Fare "not sustainable".
OL,15,FTheir call for a rise in tuition fees
OL,16,Fabove the rate of inflation was,
OL,17,Fhowever, rejected by Stormont's
OL,18,FEconomy Ministe Ms Archibald, who said
OL,19,Fit would have a "seriously detrimental
OL,20,Fimpact on higher education".
OL,26,@uD@EOUuD@UO]{D@QOU|D@[O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
