PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,FAn SEUPB spokesman said it was
OL,7,F"disappointed" that the dome project
OL,8,Fwould not proceed due to "external
OL,9,Fconsiderations and significant
OL,10,Fincreases in project costs".
OL,12,FThe spokesman added: "Ulster
OL,13,FUniversity has concluded that the dome
OL,14,Fproject is no longer financially
OL,15,Fviable.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@NO]pD@ZOUrD@[O]tD@VOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G13/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,F"Ulster University has a long-
OL,7,Festablished record of delivering
OL,8,Ftransformative funding projects
OL,9,Fthrough SEUPB-managed programmes, and
OL,10,Fwe continue to work closely together
OL,11,Fon delivery of a range of vital
OL,12,FPeacePlus initiatives in areas such as
OL,13,Fhealth, innovation, good relations,
OL,14,Fclimate and the environment.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G14/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41815
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,F"Across successive funding programmes,
OL,7,FSEUPB has worked with various partners
OL,8,Fto deliver major projects across the
OL,9,Fnorth west, including the Peace
OL,10,FBridge, the North-West Greenway and
OL,11,Fthe Transport Hub, and while this
OL,12,Fproject would have been an excellent
OL,13,Faddition, we recognise Ulster
OL,14,FUniversity's efforts to find a
OL,15,Fresolution and respect their final
OL,16,Fdecision.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G15/16
