FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41816
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786195093
OL,3,CAir Dome plans at Ulster University's
OL,4,CMagee campus scrapped
OL,6,F"We will continue to work closely with
OL,7,Fall our partners to explore future
OL,8,Ffunding opportunities that support
OL,9,Fsustainable, impactful projects for
OL,10,Fcommunities across the area and
OL,11,Fthroughout Northern Ireland and the
OL,12,Fborder counties of Ireland."
